        </h1>

        <div class="text-xl font-medium text-brown-mid tracking-wide mb-4">
          I'm a <span id="typed" class="text-accent font-bold ml-1"></span>
        </div>

        <p class="text-brown-muted text-[1.02rem] max-w-[540px] leading-[1.75] mb-6">
          Building resilient healthcare web applications, streamlining
          database performance, and bridging complex clinical workflows with
          reliable infrastructure.
        </p>

        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 pt-1">
          <a
